{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://coordinator-content-repo/coordinator/schemas/doe-wake-digest.schema.json",
  "x-schema-version": "1.6.0",
  "x-bump-class": "nested-field-additive",
  "x-bump-note": "1.5.0 -> 1.6.0 (nested-field-additive) adds three optional top-level properties: `rag_degraded` (array of example-retrieval-repo degradation items), `rag_use` (the per-run rag-vs-grep receipt: totals plus per-agent rag_calls, rag_errors, grep_calls, verdict) and `halted_by` (the example-retrieval-repo halt reason with its agents, plus `layer`/`queries` for not_serving and ue_corpus_gap). Not required, so every document valid under 1.5.0 still validates. RE-VENDOR: claude-klabauter engine runs 845c33, 67f452 and 5b7303 re-vendor this schema and emit the fields. PRIOR: 1.4.0 -> 1.5.0 (enum-value-additive) widens `next_action.op` for `kind: terminal_commit` from the const `dispatch.terminal_commit` to the enum {`dispatch.terminal_commit`, `dispatch.land_run`}, so the run-end commit op may be named `dispatch.land_run`. Every document valid under 1.4.0 still validates. RE-VENDOR: claude-klabauter C12 switches WAKE_DIGEST_COMMIT_OP. PRIOR: 1.3.1 -> 1.4.0 (nested-field-additive) adds optional `criterion.reason` (string or null, max 200): the judge's one-line reason, including the emitted workflow's demotion of a met return, so a non-met criterion is never reasonless. Not required, so every document valid under 1.3.1 still validates. RE-VENDOR: claude-klabauter-24 emits it. PRIOR: 1.3.0 -> 1.3.1 (enum-value-additive) lets a `close` digest whose outcome is `indeterminate` (a chain halted after its execute child returned) carry `next_action.kind: terminal_commit`; a `complete` close still pins `none`. Every document valid under 1.3.0 still validates. PRIOR: 1.2.0 -> 1.3.0 (enum-value-additive) adds `next_action.kind: terminal_commit`: a chain halted after its execute child returned names `dispatch.terminal_commit` with open params that must carry `script_path` and `task_output_path`. The plan triple moves into the `execute` branch unchanged, so every document valid under 1.2.0 still validates. RE-VENDOR: claude-klabauter-24 switches the chain driver to fill it. PRIOR: 1.1.0 -> 1.2.0 (nested-field-additive) widens `next_action.op`/`params` from null to string-or-null / object-or-null: a ready `plan` digest names the chain's logical op `plan_chain.run` and its params {plan_path, sizing_object, deliverable_id}; `kind: none` keeps both null. Every document valid under 1.1.0 still validates. PRIOR: 1.0.0 -> 1.1.0 (nested-field-additive) declares the optional `chain` block (stages_run, halted_at, halt_reason, commit) the sizing-to-commit chain writes into its final digest. Every document valid under 1.0.0 still validates.",
  "title": "DoE wake digest",
  "description": "The code-assembled digest for the two turns DoE assembles itself: `plan` (planDigest, turn 2) and `close` (workstream-complete's Final Summary, turn 4). Named apart from the engine repo's execute digest so two different contracts never share a filename; the execute digest is validated against the engine repo coordinator_core/contract/wake-digest.schema.json at HEAD 9403b9a638f4a985a374235f15381e4d7e5975c3, never restated here. Field names and caps follow that file's Design D1 table wherever they overlap (`criterion`, `decision_required`, `em_may_think_differently`, `deviations`'s per-item shape), per docs/plans/2026-09-27-four-turn-em-loop.md § Pinned interfaces. Two named differences from the execute digest: `em_may_think_differently`/`overflow` are top-level here, not nested under `review`; and `deviations` items are `{line, anchor}`, not `{chunk, kind, anchor}`, because a plan or close digest has no executed chunk to name.",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "schema", "version", "kind", "plan", "outcome", "criterion",
    "decision_required", "em_may_think_differently", "overflow",
    "deviations", "counts", "assembled_by", "next_action"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "schema": { "const": "doe-wake-digest" },
    "version": { "const": 1 },
    "kind": { "type": "string", "enum": ["plan", "close"] },
    "plan": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["path", "deliverable_id"],
      "properties": {
        "path": { "type": ["string", "null"], "maxLength": 300 },
        "deliverable_id": { "type": ["string", "null"], "maxLength": 200 }
      }
    },
    "outcome": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": ["ready", "pulled", "replan", "surfaced", "complete", "indeterminate"]
    },
    "criterion": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["status", "observation", "sidecar"],
      "properties": {
        "status": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": ["met", "not_met", "indeterminate", "not_run", "unstructured"]
        },
        "observation": { "type": ["string", "null"], "maxLength": 300 },
        "reason": { "type": ["string", "null"], "maxLength": 200 },
        "sidecar": { "type": ["string", "null"], "maxLength": 300 }
      }
    },
    "decision_required": { "type": ["string", "null"], "maxLength": 300 },
    "em_may_think_differently": {
      "type": "array",
      "maxItems": 10,
      "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/line_anchor" }
    },
    "overflow": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
    "deviations": {
      "type": "array",
      "maxItems": 10,
      "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/line_anchor" }
    },
    "counts": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["reviewers", "findings_applied", "escalations", "preflight_findings"],
      "properties": {
        "reviewers": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "findings_applied": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "escalations": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "preflight_findings": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }
      }
    },
    "assembled_by": { "type": "string", "enum": ["code", "fallback"] },
    "chain": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["stages_run", "halted_at", "halt_reason", "commit"],
      "description": "Optional: present only when the engine drove a sizing-to-commit chain. A digest without it is an in-session run. A non-null `halted_at` means the chain stopped before committing, so `commit` is null.",
      "properties": {
        "stages_run": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 5,
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/chain_stage" }
        },
        "halted_at": {
          "oneOf": [{ "$ref": "#/$defs/chain_stage" }, { "type": "null" }]
        },
        "halt_reason": { "type": ["string", "null"], "maxLength": 300 },
        "commit": {
          "type": ["object", "null"],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["sha", "receipt_path"],
          "properties": {
            "sha": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 64 },
            "receipt_path": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 300 }
          }
        }
      },
      "if": { "properties": { "halted_at": { "type": "string" } }, "required": ["halted_at"] },
      "then": { "properties": { "commit": { "type": "null" } } }
    },
    "rag_degraded": {
      "type": "array",
      "maxItems": 20,
      "description": "Optional: each example-retrieval-repo degradation the run met. Each item names its origin by `source` or `leg`.",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "anyOf": [{ "required": ["source"] }, { "required": ["leg"] }],
        "properties": {
          "source": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 100 },
          "leg": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 100 },
          "verdict": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 100 },
          "gap": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 300 },
          "branch": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 200 },
          "attempts": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
          "degraded_bands": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 20, "items": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 100 } },
          "layer": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 100 },
          "detail": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 300 }
        }
      }
    },
    "rag_use": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["installed", "tier", "tool_family", "totals", "agents"],
      "description": "Optional per-run rag-vs-grep receipt: counts of actual tool_use blocks, never mentions of tool names.",
      "properties": {
        "installed": { "type": "boolean" },
        "tier": { "type": "string", "enum": ["none", "rag", "ue"] },
        "tool_family": { "type": "string", "enum": ["project-rag", "context7", "lsp", "none"] },
        "totals": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["rag_calls", "grep_calls"],
          "properties": {
            "rag_calls": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
            "grep_calls": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }
          }
        },
        "agents": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 100,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "agent_id", "agent_type", "label", "gated",
              "rag_calls", "rag_errors", "grep_calls", "verdict"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "agent_id": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 100 },
              "agent_type": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 100 },
              "label": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 200 },
              "gated": { "type": "boolean" },
              "rag_calls": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
              "rag_errors": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
              "grep_calls": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
              "verdict": { "type": "string", "enum": ["pass", "fail", "exempt"] }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "halted_by": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["halted", "agents"],
      "description": "Optional: the example-retrieval-repo halt that stopped the run. `layer` and `queries` are required for `example_retrieval_repo_not_serving` and `ue_corpus_gap`.",
      "properties": {
        "halted": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": ["example_retrieval_repo_unused", "example_retrieval_repo_cadence", "example_retrieval_repo_not_serving", "ue_corpus_gap", "ue_retrieval_missing", "ue_retrieval_check_failed", "example_retrieval_repo_outage_reported", "ue_phase_retrieval_missing"]
        },
        "cause": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 100 },
        "friction_count": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "reports": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 100, "items": { "type": ["string", "object"] } },
        "ue_phase": { "type": "object" },
        "by_phase": { "type": "object" },
        "phase": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 50 },
        "agents": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 100,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": ["agent_id", "agent_type", "label", "rag_calls"],
            "properties": {
              "agent_id": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 100 },
              "agent_type": { "type": ["string", "null"], "maxLength": 100 },
              "label": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 200 },
              "rag_calls": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
              "ue_calls": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
              "denies": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
              "metrics_rows": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
              "phase": { "type": ["string", "null"], "maxLength": 50 },
              "structural_calls": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
              "retrievals": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }
            }
          }
        },
        "layer": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 100 },
        "queries": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 20, "items": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 300 } }
      },
      "if": { "properties": { "halted": { "enum": ["example_retrieval_repo_not_serving", "ue_corpus_gap"] } }, "required": ["halted"] },
      "then": { "required": ["layer", "queries"] }
    },
    "next_action": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["kind", "op", "params"],
      "description": "`kind: none` carries null `op`/`params`. `kind: execute` (a ready `plan` digest) names the execute stage `execute-plan` with its params: in session the EM runs `/execute-plan` on `plan_path`; a `--chain` fire's driver reads `plan_path` and runs it headless via `plan-chain-run`. `kind: terminal_commit` (a chain halted after its execute child returned) names the run-end commit op (`dispatch.terminal_commit` or `dispatch.land_run`) with the params to run unedited: the execute digest's own params plus `script_path` and `task_output_path`.",
      "properties": {
        "kind": { "type": "string", "enum": ["execute", "terminal_commit", "none"] },
        "op": { "type": ["string", "null"], "maxLength": 100 },
        "params": { "type": ["object", "null"], "maxProperties": 24 }
      },
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": { "properties": { "kind": { "const": "execute" } } },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "op": { "type": "string" },
              "params": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": ["plan_path", "sizing_object", "deliverable_id"],
                "properties": {
                  "plan_path": { "type": ["string", "null"], "maxLength": 300 },
                  "sizing_object": { "type": ["string", "null"], "maxLength": 300 },
                  "deliverable_id": { "type": ["string", "null"], "maxLength": 200 }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": { "properties": { "kind": { "const": "terminal_commit" } } },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "op": { "enum": ["dispatch.terminal_commit", "dispatch.land_run"] },
              "params": {
                "type": "object",
                "maxProperties": 24,
                "required": ["script_path", "task_output_path"],
                "properties": {
                  "script_path": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 300 },
                  "task_output_path": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 300 }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": { "properties": { "kind": { "const": "none" } } },
          "then": { "properties": { "op": { "type": "null" }, "params": { "type": "null" } } }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "allOf": [
    {
      "if": { "properties": { "kind": { "const": "plan" } } },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "outcome": { "enum": ["ready", "pulled", "replan", "surfaced"] }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": { "properties": { "kind": { "const": "close" } } },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "outcome": { "enum": ["complete", "indeterminate"] },
          "next_action": { "properties": { "kind": { "enum": ["none", "terminal_commit"] } } }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": { "properties": { "kind": { "const": "close" }, "outcome": { "const": "complete" } } },
      "then": { "properties": { "next_action": { "properties": { "kind": { "const": "none" } } } } }
    }
  ],
  "$defs": {
    "chain_stage": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": ["plan", "ready-gate", "execute", "review", "terminal-commit"]
    },
    "line_anchor": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["line", "anchor"],
      "properties": {
        "line": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 200 },
        "anchor": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 300 }
      }
    }
  }
}
